### Projekt ohne Mitarbeiter erstellen
POST http://localhost:8080/projects
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "description": "Website-Relaunch",
  "responsibleEmployeeId": 2,
  "customerId": 5,
  "customerServiceRepresentative": "Anna Müller",
  "comment": "Neuer Webauftritt",
  "startDate": "2026-11-01",
  "endDate": "2027-02-28",
  "projectEmployees": [ ]
}


### Projekt mit einem Mitarbeiter, erstellen
POST http://localhost:8080/projects
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "description": "Website-Relaunch",
  "responsibleEmployeeId": 1,
  "customerId": 5,
  "customerServiceRepresentative": "Anna Müller",
  "comment": "Neuer Webauftritt",
  "startDate": "2026-11-01",
  "endDate": "2027-02-28",
  "projectEmployees": [
    {
      "employeeId": 2,
      "qualificationID": 1
    }
  ]
}


### Projekt mit mehreren Mitarbeitern erstellen
POST http://localhost:8080/projects
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "description": "Website-Relaunch",
  "responsibleEmployeeId": 1,
  "customerId": 5,
  "customerServiceRepresentative": "Anna Müller",
  "comment": "Neuer Webauftritt",
  "startDate": "2026-11-01",
  "endDate": "2027-02-28",
  "projectEmployees": [
    {
      "employeeId": 1,
      "qualificationID": 1
    },
    {
      "employeeId": 2,
      "qualificationID": 2
    }
  ]
}


### Alle Projekte abrufen
GET http://localhost:8080/projects
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Alle Mitarbeiter im Employee-Service
GET http://localhost:8089/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Alle Projekte eines Mitarbeiters abrufen
@employeeId = 1
GET http://localhost:8080/employees/{{employeeId}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}